Responsibilities will include:

Develop marketing strategies to meet agreed company objectives targeted at two entirely different target customers: Investors and Mortgage Borrowers;

Evaluate customer research, market conditions and competitor data;

Develop and implement and run an annual marketing plan/budget;

Demonstrate technical marketing skills and company product knowledge;

Budget management: build a marketing budget from scratch and then deliver and manage all marketing activity within the agreed budget;

Manage relationships with existing and new key publications;

Assist with writing, designing and formulating marketing material;

Assisting with managing the LendInvest brand, and build its reputation through online and print-media campaigns (which may include alternative and mainstream advertisements, like tube ads; radio; TV etc).

Assist with online media placement, creative production & optimisation across paid search, social, and other digital channels;

Develop strategies for measuring KPI’s/success of various campaigns targeted as different market segments;

Partner with the business, technology and product teams to derive and test ideas and solutions;

Provide detailed reporting, analysis and forecasting activities to present to management;

