Ideally bachelors degree level qualification in Marketing or Advertising;

Ideally 2+ years of marketing experience, with demonstrable experience in developing, maintaining and delivering successful marketing strategies;

A strong understanding of customer and market dynamics and requirements;

Working knowledge of various technologies, such as Google Analytics etc;

Some experience with multivariate test tools such as Visual Website optimiser, Optimizely;

Experience with a company in alternative finance/online lending is a big plus;

Excellent communication skills with attention to detail;

A team-player, who can take responsibility, but also work independently.

