description:
We are building the next generation of video-on-demand (VoD) and are currently building an all-star team who will help turn our company into a leader in its field. Do you want to be at the crossroads of new technologies and media? Are you hungry to implement creative and practical solutions to challenging situations?

The Role

As Player & DRM Developer you will be at the cutting edge of how media and technology interact. Your primary role will be to own our player development strategy across all platforms, including DRM management and optimization.

Success in this position will require advising on optimization strategies to get the best out of players and DRM processes, which means you will be an expert on DRM and Conditional Access systems where content security plays a key role in service delivery. Within the first 30 days and beyond you will be expected to:

Develop a deep understanding of our business and maintain up-to-date knowledge on industry movements with regards to player development and DRM activities for the company;

Ensure players can be developed and extended beyond initial launch requirements; own the features roadmap;

Manage player analytics tools and ensure monitoring services are enabled and reporting back to Data Warehouse Environment; ensure delivery of critical logs to IT for incorporation into monitoring tools;

